        "text": "John Spalvins, born Janis Gunnars Spalvins, in 1936, in Latvia, was Managing Director of the Adelaide Steamship Company from 1977 until the company's collapse due to internal mismanagement and tax fraud in 1991, it was formed by a group of South Australian businessmen in 1875.",
